    "group": "Chief Librarian Mephiston",
    "summary": "This is a level 2 psychic ability. As your opponent's [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase) starts, this unit can roll 1 D6 as a [psychic roll](vsdata:core-rule/psychic-abilities) if it is not **[battle-shocked](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock)**. If you roll:\n\n- on a 1, the unit becomes battle-shocked\n- for the rest of that phase, each enemy unit within 6\" of this unit that makes a **[fall-back move](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back)** takes a **[leadership roll](vsdata:core-rule/leadership-rolls)**, and on a fail it must **[Remain Stationary](vsdata:core-rule/remain-stationary)**",
